<p>jab qaatema ba qair huwa fouj-e shaah ka<br />
kousar pa qaafila gaya pyaasi sipaah ka<br />
ghar lutgaya janaab-e risalat panaah ka<br />
qaak udh rahi thi, haal ye tha baargaah ka</p>

<p>bhaai the, na rafeeq, na wo noor-e ain the<br />
do behne rone waali thi aur ek hussain the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaate the ke waah ye taaqeer hai ajal<br />
akbar ke baad kounsa tha zeest ka mahal<br />
ab mujhko ek baras ke barabar hai ek pal<br />
mout aaye ab ye hai shajar-e zindagi ka phal</p>

<p>ek jaa churi galo'n pa jo chalti to qoob tha<br />
ye jaan unke saath nikalti to qoob tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ham sab ke baad qalq se jeene ko reh gaye<br />
sar peetne ko ashk bahaane ko reh gaye<br />
is noujawaa'n ka daagh uthaane ko reh gaye<br />
peeri me aah thok-re khaane ko reh gaye</p>

<p>beta kaha'n qabar jo dam-e inteqaal le<br />
itna nahi koi ke giru, to sambhaal le<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah soo-e laash-e pisar jaa padi nazar<br />
chillaye dil ko thaam ke sultaan-e behro bar<br />
sote ho kya dhare huwe ruqsaar qaak par<br />
akbar utho ke ghode se girta hai ab pidar</p>

<p>bhoole pidar ko neend me qurbaan aap ke<br />
aao namaaz-e asr padho saath baap ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abbas-e namdaar taraayi se uth ke aao<br />
phat- ta hai qalb, jal rahe hai sab jigar ke ghaao<br />
chidko meri ziraa pa jo paani kahi'n se paao<br />
chalte huwe adam ke musafir se milte jaao</p>

<p>ghaflat ki tum ko neend hai shabbir kya kare<br />
meri tarha kisi ko na bekas quda kare<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaya fouj ko pisar-e saad-e naabekaar<br />
lo gher lo hussain ko sab milke ek baar<br />
palte pare sawaaro'n ke lekar risaaladaar<br />
do ghoul baandhe aaye kamaa'ndar das hazaar</p>

<p>teerafghano'n me, tegho'n me, bhalo'n me ghir gaye<br />
bekas hussain barchiyo'n walo'n me ghir gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>syed ke martabe ko na jaana hazaar haif<br />
teero'n se sadr-e paak ko chaana hazaar haif<br />
shaane the naawako'n ka nishana hazaar haif<br />
mazloom ka wo barchiyaa'n khana hazaar haif</p>

<p>toote the sab rasool ke pyaare hussain par<br />
kya waqt padh gaya tha tumhaare hussain par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>girte hai aap aur sambhaale koi nahi<br />
seene se koun teer nikaale koi nahi<br />
sab mar chuke hai chaahne waale koi nahi<br />
bejaa'n pade hai godh ke paale koi nahi</p>

<p>bekas hai aap zor sipaah-e adu ka hai<br />
mu jis ka dekhte hai wo pyaasa lahu ka hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>fizza ne jaake qaime me bewo'n ko di qabar<br />
hae hae mere quzaade ka kat-ta hai tan se sar<br />
bistar se uth ke gir pade sajjad-e- nouhagar<br />
qaime se nikli bibiyaa'n bacho'n ko chod kar</p>

<p>hilta tha arsh hazrat-e zainab ke bain se<br />
gir gir ke doudhti thi ke mil li hussain se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillati thi are mera bhaai hai kis taraf<br />
looti huwi ali ki kamaayi hai kis taraf<br />
darya kidhar hai qoo'n ka taraayi hai kis taraf<br />
sone ki jaa hussain ne paayi hai kis taraf</p>

<p>rasta de aye zamee'n ke falak ki sataayi hoo'n<br />
mai apne pyaare bhaai se milne ko aayi hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mai syeda hoo'n raham karo laash ko bataao<br />
aye ahl-e qirya bint-e ali ki madad ko aao<br />
dunya me tum khushi raho uqba me chain paao<br />
syed kidhar hai qoon me ghaltaa'n bataate jaao</p>

<p>yaa'n lut gaye falak ne ye dukh ham pa daale hai<br />
aye bhaaiyo madine ke ham rehne waale hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sheh ke karaahne ki jo aane lagi sadaa<br />
doudhi udhar nabi ki nawaasi barehna paa<br />
dekha behen ne kat-te huwe bhaai ka gala<br />
aankho'n pa haath rakh ke giri bint-e murtuza</p>

<p>gham se kaleja phat gaya zehra ki jaayi ka<br />
utthi to dekha naize pe sar apne bhaai ka<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>